%% CYO Adventure - Entity-Relationship Diagram (Mermaid)
%% Companion to er-diagram.puml / er-diagram.svg for inline rendering on GitHub
%% (GitHub renders ```mermaid fences natively; it does not render PlantUML).
%% er-diagram.puml remains the authoritative source: it carries the full CHECK
%% constraint list, ON DELETE semantics, and the attribution-FK note. This file
%% is maintained by hand alongside it and is not regenerated by
%% tools/generate_diagram_svgs.py.
%% Source: src/cyo_adventure/db/models.py (30 ORM tables)

erDiagram
